## Title: |cFF69B4PB's Auto Loot|r 0.1.4
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Takes everything when a loot window opens, opens the boxes you pick up and takes what is inside, and binds set pieces you have not collected yet so they are added to your set collection.
## Version: 0.1.4
## AddOnVersion: 5
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsAutoLoot_Data

